  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> projected with a velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> making an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math> with the horizontal. The magnitude of angular momentum of the projectile about the point of projection when the particle is at its maximum height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "UXezq",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "TTN1B",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "kFbtm",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Nubcw",
      "text": " zero",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Angular momentum at maximum height will be, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>h</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo></math>maximum height</p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
